  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nRadius of hemisphere = 7 ÷ 2\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nTotal surface area of hemisphere = 3πr²\n\nSurface area of sphere = 4πR²\n\nVolume of sphere = (4 ÷ 3)πR³\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 3π × (7 ÷ 2)² = 4πR²\n\n⇒ 3 × (49 ÷ 4) = 4R²\n\n⇒ 147 ÷ 4 = 4R²\n\n⇒ R² = 147 ÷ 16\n\n⇒ R = √147 ÷ 4\n\n⇒ √147 = 7√3\n\n⇒ R = 7√3 ÷ 4\n\n⇒ R³ = (7√3 ÷ 4)³\n\n⇒ = 7³ × (√3)³ ÷ 4³\n\n⇒ = 343 × 3√3 ÷ 64\n\n⇒ = 1029√3 ÷ 64\n\n⇒ Volume = (4 ÷ 3) × (22 ÷ 7) × (1029√3 ÷ 64)\n\n⇒ = (4 × 22 × 1029√3) ÷ (3 × 7 × 64)\n\n⇒ = (22 × 1029√3) ÷ (3 × 7 × 16)\n\n⇒ = (22 × 147√3) ÷ (3 × 16)\n\n⇒ = (22 × 49√3) ÷ 16\n\n⇒ = 1078√3 ÷ 16\n\n⇒ = 539√3 ÷ 8\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 539√3 ÷ 8.**",
